# Local dev server

Do not start, restart, or stop the local site. The user runs it in their own terminal so the log stays visible.

From `web/`:

```
npm start
```

That is `node server.js`, on port 8643. If a check needs the site and nothing is listening, say so and give that command. Do not launch it in the background.
